WEBVTT

00:02.765 --> 00:05.095
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:05.205 --> 00:08.265
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.735 --> 00:11.475
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:11.475 --> 00:16.135
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:16.545 --> 00:23.545
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:25.255 --> 00:28.125
Dragon Drive

00:28.125 --> 00:33.655
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.765 --> 00:36.735
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:36.735 --> 00:39.995
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:40.465 --> 00:44.845
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:44.845 --> 00:46.805
ima mo
I'd still...

00:46.805 --> 00:53.145
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:54.855 --> 00:57.215
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:57.215 --> 01:00.455
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.755 --> 01:05.765
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.765 --> 01:07.355
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:07.465 --> 01:09.865
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:09.865 --> 01:13.025
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:13.405 --> 01:18.475
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:18.475 --> 01:21.215
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:21.215 --> 01:28.915
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:41.365 --> 01:45.095
I think I'll defeat everyone here
within ten minutes.

01:50.835 --> 01:52.635
I'll finish you off in one move!

01:54.275 --> 01:55.445
Chibi.

01:55.445 --> 01:57.205
Lend me your strength!

02:10.625 --> 02:11.465
Why?

02:11.465 --> 02:14.755
How could something so little
have so much power?!

02:15.295 --> 02:18.065
I-It's impossible!

02:19.735 --> 02:21.505
Maiko!

02:21.505 --> 02:24.095
With that, I'm no longer a liar!

02:26.575 --> 02:29.665
Revenge

02:34.385 --> 02:36.155
Okay, then. I'll see you there!

02:36.155 --> 02:38.625
Darn it. Sometimes you're so mean!

02:38.625 --> 02:41.595
You could wait until
the committee meeting's over!

02:41.595 --> 02:43.555
Sorry, I can't!

02:43.555 --> 02:46.685
I need to get to
the Dragon Drive Center at once...

02:46.995 --> 02:49.865
...to receive my experience points
from yesterday's battle.

02:49.865 --> 02:51.435
I earned a bunch, after all!

02:51.435 --> 02:53.165
Boy, I can't wait, I can't wait! Bye!

02:53.165 --> 02:54.195
Hey!

02:57.435 --> 03:01.635
Reiji's practically obsessed
with Dragon Drive now!

03:01.945 --> 03:03.535
Honestly!

03:04.345 --> 03:06.915
D-Darn that Reiji Ozora.

03:06.915 --> 03:11.355
He's talking awfully friendly
with my sweet honey, Maiko Yukino.

03:11.355 --> 03:13.825
He's not getting away with it!

03:14.625 --> 03:16.595
Later.

03:18.995 --> 03:21.395
Hey, Kyoji! Wait for me!

03:24.605 --> 03:27.105
Huh? Don't fight against Reiji Ozora?

03:27.105 --> 03:30.635
Right! I'll be the one who crushes him!

03:30.635 --> 03:31.745
For sure!

03:31.745 --> 03:34.605
So promise you won't ever try
to fight against him, all right?!

03:42.685 --> 03:43.545
Why?

03:44.725 --> 03:47.215
Why do you want to beat
Reiji Ozora so badly?

03:56.735 --> 03:58.235
What an awful drawing!

03:58.235 --> 03:59.735
You're really lousy!

03:59.735 --> 04:01.665
Daisuke, you draw great!

04:06.205 --> 04:08.545
It's a great drawing. I love it.

04:08.945 --> 04:12.145
I love it... I love it... I love it...

04:13.345 --> 04:17.345
Maiko Yukino was the only one
who understood my greatness.

04:17.555 --> 04:22.695
Yes, from that day forward,
Maiko became My Sweet Honey!

04:22.695 --> 04:25.025
She's my one and only angel!

04:25.265 --> 04:26.885
What are you blushing for?

04:27.935 --> 04:31.265
Don't tell me you're in love
with Reiji Ozora?

04:31.265 --> 04:32.465
Wha?!

04:32.465 --> 04:34.305
N-Nothing like that!

04:34.305 --> 04:37.365
I wanna beat his brains out
'cause I can't stand him!

04:38.205 --> 04:40.175
What's he so gung-ho about?

04:46.385 --> 04:47.815
Reiji Ozora.

04:48.455 --> 04:49.945
He certainly piques my interest.

04:54.655 --> 04:57.125
What?! No experience points?!

04:57.155 --> 04:58.425
You're kidding!

04:58.425 --> 05:00.295
I played the game, and I won!

05:00.295 --> 05:02.555
Shall I check it again for you?

05:06.635 --> 05:08.835
No, I still show no points.

05:08.835 --> 05:10.735
Are you sure you played a valid game?

05:10.735 --> 05:12.175
I already told you I did!

05:12.175 --> 05:14.005
I beat a guy called Ichiro Sumishiba!

05:14.005 --> 05:14.675
What?!

05:14.675 --> 05:18.005
You mean the Ichiro Sumishiba,
ranked second in the A Block ranking?!

05:18.885 --> 05:21.015
You're lying.

05:21.015 --> 05:22.555
You don't believe me!

05:22.555 --> 05:24.845
It's unreasonable to expect her to believe it.

05:25.955 --> 05:26.945
Kyoji...

05:27.255 --> 05:28.595
Please tell her!

05:28.595 --> 05:30.995
You saw, right?!
You were in the game, too!

05:30.995 --> 05:33.465
- Tell her!
- I wouldn't know.

05:33.895 --> 05:36.595
I was fighting other opponents, you see.

05:36.595 --> 05:38.235
C-Come on...

05:38.235 --> 05:39.925
Outta my way!

05:41.935 --> 05:43.835
What did you do that for?!

05:44.405 --> 05:45.775
Why, you're...

05:50.215 --> 05:52.285
...the guy who lost to me!
- Why, you!

05:52.285 --> 05:53.745
At least remember my name!

05:53.745 --> 05:55.885
Daisuke Hagiwara of Class 2A!

05:55.885 --> 05:57.285
2A?

05:57.285 --> 05:58.415
That's next door to my class.

05:59.825 --> 06:02.425
I see you're not with Maiko Yukino today.

06:02.425 --> 06:04.155
Wh-What is it?

06:04.155 --> 06:06.425
You making up a reason to fight again?

06:06.495 --> 06:07.895
I know the truth!

06:07.895 --> 06:09.525
A-About what?

06:09.665 --> 06:12.635
I checked out the relationship
between you and Maiko.

06:12.635 --> 06:14.635
You're friends from childhood!

06:14.635 --> 06:16.535
Nothing less, nothing more!

06:16.535 --> 06:18.565
That's what I've been saying all along.

06:18.975 --> 06:21.405
Anyway, what are you to Maiko?

06:21.615 --> 06:25.215
I've known her for a really
long time, but I don't know you!

06:25.215 --> 06:28.055
Wh-Why do I hafta tell someone
who's only her childhood friend?!

06:28.055 --> 06:29.915
Wh-What did you say?!

06:29.915 --> 06:31.385
Calm down, you two.

06:31.385 --> 06:33.145
Why not resolve your quarrel with a game?

06:33.385 --> 06:35.725
Oh, and I'm playing as well.

06:35.925 --> 06:36.915
Ah, yes.

06:37.325 --> 06:39.325
Today's Daisuke will be a tough opponent.

06:39.325 --> 06:40.925
He's got a trump card.

06:40.925 --> 06:41.865
"Trump card"?

06:41.865 --> 06:42.895
R-Right.

06:42.895 --> 06:45.635
Ma'am, is the card I ordered here?

06:45.635 --> 06:47.765
Oh. Yes it is!

06:47.905 --> 06:51.065
Here you are, the Dragon Parts
"Elemental Shift".

06:51.305 --> 06:53.705
Ele... lelele... What's that?

06:55.375 --> 06:57.475
"Elemental Shift".

06:57.475 --> 07:02.285
Using this card during the game allows me
to fire a finishing move in any situation.

07:02.755 --> 07:04.585
Wow. Cool.

07:05.225 --> 07:07.725
I don't know how you feel about it...

07:07.725 --> 07:10.925
...but I'm not satisfied with the outcome
of that last crazy game!

07:11.255 --> 07:13.385
But I'm the one who won that game.

07:13.795 --> 07:16.235
Shut up! I had my guard down!

07:16.235 --> 07:18.925
But it's different this time!
I'll fight against you seriously!

07:19.565 --> 07:20.505
Fine, then.

07:20.505 --> 07:23.235
I won't lose to any guy I've beaten before.

07:23.235 --> 07:27.045
I'm none other than the guy who defeated
that Ichiro Sumishiba, after all.

07:27.045 --> 07:29.035
What?! Ichiro Sumishiba?!

07:29.445 --> 07:31.575
- Really?
- I wouldn't know.

07:33.585 --> 07:35.445
I'm telling the truth!

07:38.455 --> 07:42.215
Hi! Are all players ready?

07:42.625 --> 07:44.195
Let's get excited!

07:44.195 --> 07:45.395
And have fun!

07:45.395 --> 07:48.555
And fight intensely upon our dragons,
like we always do!

07:57.935 --> 07:59.105
Okay!

07:59.105 --> 08:00.475
Dragon Drive!

08:03.875 --> 08:05.845
D-Break!

08:16.795 --> 08:18.955
S, it's all yours.

08:19.365 --> 08:21.455
Then shall we get started?

08:28.875 --> 08:32.275
I wonder if Reiji's
started the game already.

08:32.945 --> 08:35.845
- Wow, look at all these people.
- You can watch from here.

08:35.845 --> 08:37.475
Thank you.

08:37.675 --> 08:39.045
You're welcome.

08:39.345 --> 08:40.585
Yuck! Ichiro!

08:40.585 --> 08:41.815
What do you mean by that?

08:41.815 --> 08:43.945
I have to go... over there.

08:45.085 --> 08:49.215
Are you sure you don't want to watch?
Your good friend appears to be in trouble.

08:51.765 --> 08:53.555
Help me!

08:54.565 --> 08:56.725
Yay. Run, run.

08:57.265 --> 09:00.995
I'm pretty sure I've seen
this exact situation before.

09:02.135 --> 09:04.365
Serves you right, Reiji Ozora!

09:04.875 --> 09:06.905
But this is exactly how the last game went!

09:06.905 --> 09:08.275
Come on and attack!

09:09.145 --> 09:11.275
I'd love to seriously fight back!

09:11.645 --> 09:15.085
But Chibi won't move like I want him to!

09:19.255 --> 09:19.885
Oh, no!

09:19.885 --> 09:23.485
Reiji has tripped spectacularly
where there is nothing to trip on!

09:25.425 --> 09:27.415
Do you really wanna fight or not?!

09:29.295 --> 09:30.395
Chibi!

09:30.395 --> 09:32.865
He's totally making fun of you!

09:32.865 --> 09:35.425
Doesn't that bother you?!
It does, right?! Right?! Right?!

09:36.975 --> 09:37.675
All right!

09:37.675 --> 09:39.805
Show him what you're made of!

09:39.805 --> 09:42.505
Show him what a man's made of!

09:43.775 --> 09:46.045
Fire!

09:54.895 --> 09:56.885
I get it.

09:57.125 --> 09:59.995
You're making fun of me.

10:00.695 --> 10:01.935
I'm getting nothing today.

10:01.935 --> 10:04.625
Just sit back and watch, it won't be long.

10:18.285 --> 10:21.445
I was hoping to see that again, but...

10:34.465 --> 10:35.395
Kyoji.

10:47.905 --> 10:49.615
Kyoji, stay outta this!

10:49.615 --> 10:52.305
I'm the one who'll defeat Reiji Ozora!

10:52.515 --> 10:55.315
I don't remember agreeing to that.

10:55.515 --> 10:56.505
What?!

11:07.625 --> 11:09.355
What's the big idea, Kyoji?!

11:09.535 --> 11:13.525
I said I'd defeat him,
and you promised not to fight against him!

11:13.565 --> 11:15.375
I never promised anything of the sort.

11:15.375 --> 11:17.095
And besides, it's frustrating to watch.

11:26.645 --> 11:30.185
Reiji Ozora, show me one more time.

11:30.185 --> 11:31.555
Show me your power.

11:33.585 --> 11:35.525
Chibi's... trembling.

11:49.705 --> 11:51.765
I'm defeating Reiji Ozora!

11:51.945 --> 11:53.065
Don't interfere!

11:53.505 --> 11:54.305
Daisuke.

11:54.305 --> 11:58.505
You know, I've been bothered
by the way you keep hanging around me.

11:59.385 --> 12:00.605
You really get on my nerves!

12:09.425 --> 12:11.485
Stop doing what's useless.

12:13.695 --> 12:15.125
H-He's strong.

12:16.095 --> 12:18.295
But I am, too!

12:24.775 --> 12:27.545
It's getting messy, do you wanna continue?

12:27.545 --> 12:29.245
Of course, S!

12:29.245 --> 12:32.045
Then let me bring in a little drama.

12:32.045 --> 12:33.875
Sure. Go for it!

12:35.355 --> 12:37.975
I hate to interrupt men fighting...

12:39.225 --> 12:41.315
...but I'm going to crash the party.

12:44.225 --> 12:45.455
What's that?

12:56.305 --> 12:57.295
What?!

12:59.705 --> 13:00.305
Wow!

13:00.305 --> 13:01.705
Today's their lucky day!

13:02.145 --> 13:04.815
The player who defeats this hidden character
earns double the experience points!

13:04.815 --> 13:07.075
Entering is Drew, the unmanned dragon!

13:08.955 --> 13:10.885
- Ten minutes.
- Huh?! What is?

13:10.885 --> 13:13.785
The number of minutes before
Reiji gets wiped out by that Drew.

13:13.785 --> 13:16.015
That sounds like the failed prediction
you made last time.

13:16.955 --> 13:18.855
Go get 'em! Reiji!

13:22.135 --> 13:24.565
Yay. Run, run, run.

13:25.205 --> 13:27.105
That's good! Turn the heat up on him!

13:37.515 --> 13:39.485
I'm the one who'll defeat Reiji Ozora!

13:39.745 --> 13:41.645
I don't want you getting in my way, either!

13:41.955 --> 13:43.615
I'm being ignored?

13:43.615 --> 13:44.745
Well, not that I mind.

13:55.465 --> 13:58.695
I want some accurate data on Reiji Ozora.

14:00.735 --> 14:03.635
Why don't I start off by clearing away
the guy getting in my way, first?

14:11.115 --> 14:12.045
Wh-What?!

14:17.185 --> 14:18.175
Daisuke!

14:20.725 --> 14:21.885
H-Hey...

14:26.725 --> 14:28.625
B-But why?

14:35.635 --> 14:36.765
Oh, come on.

14:37.535 --> 14:39.535
What good is it if the players fall in a hole?

14:44.075 --> 14:46.135
Oww...

14:46.715 --> 14:48.045
My leg's stuck...

14:48.385 --> 14:49.855
I can't get it out.

14:55.595 --> 14:56.785
What's that sound?

14:57.225 --> 14:59.315
It's the battle between Kanper and Drew.

14:59.765 --> 15:00.495
Daisuke.

15:00.495 --> 15:02.195
Boy, you're lame.

15:02.965 --> 15:06.135
What good is it to try to help me
if you end up falling with me?

15:06.135 --> 15:07.465
How dare you?!

15:09.605 --> 15:13.545
Makes it awkward to thank
you if you don't succeed.

15:13.745 --> 15:14.605
Well, then...

15:14.605 --> 15:16.215
...if you're having trouble thanking me...

15:16.215 --> 15:18.505
...then at least help move this rock!

15:18.745 --> 15:21.215
When the time's up, we'll
automatically get outta here, anyway.

15:21.215 --> 15:22.315
You're kidding!

15:22.315 --> 15:24.385
You're gonna sit there 'til we run outta time?

15:24.385 --> 15:27.655
If we hold on to him, we can fly outta here!

15:27.655 --> 15:28.845
Kanper's still out there fighting!

15:31.865 --> 15:36.325
Kanper ignored my orders to evade
the foe, and is fighting on his own.

15:36.795 --> 15:38.955
As a result, his hit points are close to zero.

15:39.105 --> 15:40.795
What a dimwitted dragon.

15:41.505 --> 15:43.265
It's game over, no matter how you slice it.

15:43.605 --> 15:45.635
What's the use in vain efforts?!

15:48.105 --> 15:49.115
Listen.

15:49.115 --> 15:50.875
Kanper's still fighting.

15:51.075 --> 15:54.345
Who do you think he's fighting for,
that he'd ignore orders?!

15:55.285 --> 15:57.685
Why fight when you know you'll lose?

15:57.685 --> 15:59.415
That's just plain pathetic.

16:03.625 --> 16:06.215
Why do you always quit
in the middle of things?!

16:06.795 --> 16:09.265
Because I look pathetic
doing what I'm not good at doing.

16:09.495 --> 16:13.125
Right now, you look even more pathetic
because you always give up and quit!

16:20.275 --> 16:22.505
We won't know until we try!

16:22.915 --> 16:25.745
I made a decision that with this game...

16:26.215 --> 16:28.545
...I'll never hit the reset,
no matter how close I come to losing!

16:42.095 --> 16:43.085
Cold...

16:44.365 --> 16:45.355
Blood?!

16:46.905 --> 16:47.865
No way!

16:47.865 --> 16:50.565
Is Kanper still fighting?!

16:58.375 --> 17:00.345
And yet I...

17:00.545 --> 17:01.815
...I...

17:08.225 --> 17:09.355
Daisuke!

17:09.355 --> 17:11.395
I'm not doing this to help you!

17:11.395 --> 17:13.015
I'm doing this for Kanper, got that?!

17:21.065 --> 17:22.505
You can do it, Chibi!

17:34.915 --> 17:36.855
Oww...

17:39.485 --> 17:40.475
Kanper!

17:44.925 --> 17:49.925
You were fighting while supporting
the building, all to protect us?

17:50.365 --> 17:52.695
Don't just stand there, Daisuke!

17:53.665 --> 17:55.155
You help, too!

17:58.035 --> 17:59.905
- Reiji!
- Daisuke!

17:59.905 --> 18:01.805
At this rate, Kanper'll end up being crushed!

18:01.805 --> 18:04.215
Are you out of your mind?!
What good will pushing him do?!

18:04.215 --> 18:07.115
It may not be much, but it's a lot better...

18:07.115 --> 18:09.675
...than watching and doing nothing!

18:27.965 --> 18:30.005
What else can we do?!

18:30.005 --> 18:32.745
We'll find a chance to turn this around!

18:32.745 --> 18:34.775
There's no such thing!

18:34.775 --> 18:37.265
No! I know there's a way!

18:37.575 --> 18:39.275
I'm sure there is!

18:45.355 --> 18:47.615
Ow! What the heck are you doing?!

18:52.565 --> 18:54.155
Elemental Shift!

18:56.195 --> 18:58.665
I told you! There's our chance!

18:58.835 --> 19:02.735
You can fire your finishing move
from any situation with that, right?!

19:02.975 --> 19:04.905
Okay! Here we go, Kanper!

19:07.275 --> 19:09.645
Let's finish it off with one shot!

19:09.845 --> 19:11.365
Show us that you're a man!

19:20.685 --> 19:22.415
Elemental Shift!

19:56.525 --> 19:58.995
Your Kanper was awesome!

19:59.125 --> 20:00.995
Sure, part of it was the power of the card.

20:00.995 --> 20:03.695
But still, to destroy a whole building
with one shot?!

20:04.295 --> 20:05.695
No. He's wrong.

20:05.905 --> 20:08.635
That wasn't one of Kanper's moves.

20:08.735 --> 20:11.175
Kanper doesn't have the ability
to stage such an attack.

20:28.555 --> 20:30.425
Hey, you've gotta be kidding.

20:30.955 --> 20:34.185
That Drew I brought in isn't a dragon
that can be defeated with a single shot.

20:34.325 --> 20:37.825
Also, Kanper doesn't have
an attack as strong as that.

20:38.965 --> 20:42.095
Is someone adding a little
something extra to this game?

20:43.975 --> 20:45.995
S, how are the agents reacting?

20:47.605 --> 20:51.605
They all left, around the time
when Reiji Ozora fell through that hole.

20:51.945 --> 20:53.115
Come on!

20:53.115 --> 20:55.215
They missed the best part!

20:55.215 --> 20:56.615
They sure did.

20:56.615 --> 20:59.415
The agents don't get it at all.

21:05.425 --> 21:06.565
Wh-What is it?

21:06.565 --> 21:09.465
I-I thank you, Reiji Ozora.

21:10.935 --> 21:12.295
Just call me Reiji.

21:13.165 --> 21:14.655
R-Reiji!

21:18.905 --> 21:19.895
Hey!

21:21.875 --> 21:23.515
You were both great!

21:23.515 --> 21:24.445
Weren't we?!

21:24.445 --> 21:26.985
If we join forces, no one can beat us!

21:26.985 --> 21:28.275
Right, Daisuke?!

21:28.885 --> 21:31.855
Why would I wanna join forces with you?!

21:31.855 --> 21:33.445
Huh? What's wrong?

21:33.855 --> 21:35.795
I don't believe in teaming up!

21:35.795 --> 21:37.885
Wait! Where are you going?!

21:39.195 --> 21:41.595
Reiji... Ozora...

21:57.415 --> 22:00.145
taikutsu datta
I was bored

22:00.145 --> 22:02.915
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:02.915 --> 22:06.875
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:08.325 --> 22:11.095
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:11.095 --> 22:13.285
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:13.725 --> 22:17.855
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:19.265 --> 22:21.935
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:21.935 --> 22:24.675
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:24.675 --> 22:28.665
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:29.975 --> 22:32.485
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:32.485 --> 22:35.485
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:35.485 --> 22:40.385
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:41.025 --> 22:43.755
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:43.755 --> 22:46.525
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:46.525 --> 22:51.195
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
